  title: Sanctuary of Osiris
  description: 'Four large and elaborate statuettes of Osiris were found

    at
    the edge of the North Canal in the

    northeast harbour associated with

    monumental
    sandstone architectural

    elements. This suggests that in this location may
    have been a sanctuary or a

    pier connected to the worship of Osiris.'
